# Ultra Space (plan 23 · Z8): the worlds behind the Ultra Wormhole and Ultra Megalopolis, a city without light. A celesta
# turning in whole tones over a choir that never resolves, a slow harp and a low synth bass on a drone of E; no drums,
# so nothing here has a pulse anyone on Alola would know. The same by day and by night.
# Original composition for this game, in the modern sound.
